[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-65117"] :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+16y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+B\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x,\n$$\n\nsolve the following initial value problem:\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+16y=0,\\,y(0)=1,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-4.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions.\n\n- Substituting $y(0)=1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-4,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=4A\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x-4B\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=-4$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4=4A\\,⟹\\,A=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection/e82914507044cfa54107eca4a9875b1db3b0c2eaa6b355f10d9a75b2d174fccd" :answer/id #uuid "3206ec8d-430e-5233-9401-d04e560c71cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{-x}+6x{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection/8bbbbcfe6316f0a8aaf9b643d206b3d04768ef8ce2b8ea055cac1dc2167708b7" :answer/id #uuid "fe3662cf-eb77-50bd-8423-cd52bc16d5b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{-x}+8x{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection/25fc402f94cd1d085c1a4ac77c8eff7290a237027379b06bba5808dca7a9ae9c" :answer/id #uuid "8b7f6f36-998e-53bf-b5ba-b9a7938fda69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{-x}-8x{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection/2875f684d5fcc3db75fc1332ad33ce2e2d010321b7793e530724602e6c5f5f50" :answer/id #uuid "1069cf11-3e42-50fe-a737-e26c7caa7f40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{-x}+4x{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection/1394517b3df92c8e6489d0a19fec49a009c9a715f6e3a4315e1d18b9333ee5ca" :answer/id #uuid "f3427423-ce64-5e6e-8a38-831c684e2f35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8{e}^{-x}-4x{e}^{-x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb9f6266-adb6-510b-96d6-5c2926e352dc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94017/selection/8bbbbcfe6316f0a8aaf9b643d206b3d04768ef8ce2b8ea055cac1dc2167708b7" :answer-field/choices ["q-94017/selection/e82914507044cfa54107eca4a9875b1db3b0c2eaa6b355f10d9a75b2d174fccd" "q-94017/selection/8bbbbcfe6316f0a8aaf9b643d206b3d04768ef8ce2b8ea055cac1dc2167708b7" "q-94017/selection/25fc402f94cd1d085c1a4ac77c8eff7290a237027379b06bba5808dca7a9ae9c" "q-94017/selection/2875f684d5fcc3db75fc1332ad33ce2e2d010321b7793e530724602e6c5f5f50" "q-94017/selection/1394517b3df92c8e6489d0a19fec49a009c9a715f6e3a4315e1d18b9333ee5ca"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94017" :question/id #uuid "08939a7c-c0f3-5976-a888-8e7f9abb04aa" :question/math-academy-id "q-94017" :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-x}+Bx{e}^{-x},\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+y=0,\\,y(0)=8,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $A$ and $B$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=8$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA=8.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=0,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-A{e}^{-x}+B{e}^{-x}-Bx{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=0$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n-A+B=0.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $A=8$ gives $B=8.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=8{e}^{-x}+8x{e}^{-x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94017/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84e87d0d-806d-5587-849e-17d6999dbbd1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94017"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection/fb1dd2823d8942111ffdc796599b34f619d01b2f826b634727abe68b3c793907" :answer/id #uuid "9e756dfb-3c00-583f-a870-598dd392b44b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection/03e1f7dab781fad18a7920d306929b8d76acd87ca6df8cd1e9c60fbdecb4763c" :answer/id #uuid "0a902351-68a3-54e1-bfcb-27662cb18157" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection/492899182813992b2180666d7ec31672a41d423f95fb4d75721dd614bfbb7ecf" :answer/id #uuid "1e3567c8-a695-5bd1-a541-e371a84c378f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+5\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection/2aacf2c63702d4e201f90b6935b21ac5ce78770ffa6b11a04d95aaf1d4282a7c" :answer/id #uuid "635acc79-7b3a-5c41-bfee-ebb3a765e305" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection/9261b7f632eecc721b92126da893c5a3d924b4e964f9518d62059a146dce79a9" :answer/id #uuid "9a354572-ff97-5fd7-b254-59d7149ca4c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba9b0706-fa5f-58e2-9a10-da0c49fed6e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-94031/selection/9261b7f632eecc721b92126da893c5a3d924b4e964f9518d62059a146dce79a9" :answer-field/choices ["q-94031/selection/fb1dd2823d8942111ffdc796599b34f619d01b2f826b634727abe68b3c793907" "q-94031/selection/03e1f7dab781fad18a7920d306929b8d76acd87ca6df8cd1e9c60fbdecb4763c" "q-94031/selection/492899182813992b2180666d7ec31672a41d423f95fb4d75721dd614bfbb7ecf" "q-94031/selection/2aacf2c63702d4e201f90b6935b21ac5ce78770ffa6b11a04d95aaf1d4282a7c" "q-94031/selection/9261b7f632eecc721b92126da893c5a3d924b4e964f9518d62059a146dce79a9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94031" :question/id #uuid "20b8d32e-a707-5956-8ecb-9412b3c07a1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-94031" :question/problem "Given that the differential equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+17y=0\n$$\n\nhas the general solution\n\n$$\ny={e}^{-x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x),\n$$\n\nsolve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}+17y=0,\\,y(0)=-1,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=-11.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We find the constants $P$ and $Q$ using the initial conditions. \n\n- Substituting $y(0)=-1$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nP=-1.\n$$\n\n- To apply the condition ${y}^{′}(0)=-11,$ we first differentiate $y$ to get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=-{e}^{-x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)+{e}^{-x}(-4P\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+4Q\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x).\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute ${y}^{′}(0)=-11$ into the above to get\n\n$$\n-P+4Q=-11.\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $P=-1$ gives $Q=-3.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-94031/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "20e5f532-d99f-5406-b006-f34aa9074819"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94031"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130353/selection/d2c0dd65269380577e3a2608c09c318b47487906918cb150be7f1f3e55a6767e" :answer/id #uuid "67e15767-19e6-5657-8520-f74c4f5015ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡9x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130353/selection/bf23a6d932f28f1d37d5cf290846d9ce53c